{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52929","headline":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗 · 苏㝢","name":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独坐理戎行，安边策最长。\n霜台雷电振，云汉翼箕张。\n决策威千里，除妖静一方。\n林峦开罨画，泉石韵宫商。\n戍罢泾川外，烽闲句水阳。\n肃清淮海後，谁不咏时康。\n（见嘉庆十一年刊洪亮吉纂《泾县志》卷三十）（按：赵绍祖《泾川金石记》载北宋熙宁二年蒋之奇跋此诗文，知之奇当时曾重刻此碑。\n清代碑已不存，而诸诗则载於县志中。\n同唱五人，惟㝢诗《全唐诗》失收。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏㝢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}